<section class="section advice"><div><p class="eyebrow">Practical advice</p><h2>Before you replace it, know what it needs.</h2><p>Assess workload, condition and supportability before recommending a purchase.</p></div><div><article><h3>KEEP.</h3><p>Still right for the job? Keep it.</p></article><article><h3>UPGRADE.</h3><p>A specific bottleneck? Check the upgrade.</p></article><article><h3>REPLACE.</h3><p>No sensible supported path? Replace it to fit the workload.</p></article><small>Illustrative decisions, not a diagnosis or client case study.</small></div></section>